      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-02T01:00:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there has been an issue with copying the code over. The upstream PoC did have a check for CAP_BPF: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260813002618.3755631-3-tweek@google.com/",
      "parentUuid": "32aee898_e359c9c3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 11,
