      },
      "lineNbr": 232,
      "author": {
        "id": 1953271
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-02T13:29:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, that\u0027s my bad. I have included a `bpf_capable()` check which covers both CAP_SYS_ADMIN and CAP_BPF. Let me know if we want to restrict to CAP_BPF only.",
      "parentUuid": "0228ff33_3397f5af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 232,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "01aa9adf2f9634f68cff53f46e713bdeb9c7cbb7",
